  "summary_en": "White paper by the Austrian Council on Robotics and AI, advising the transport and innovation ministry. It proposes cornerstones of smart governance, innovation and regulation, and four action fields: technology and R&D, work and skills, society and law, and public awareness. It recommends an incremental strategy process, sandboxes, certification and audit tools, and adapted liability rules.",
