   "Recommends sandboxes and testbeds for high-risk, sensitive use cases",
   "Recommends reviewing ethical and legal frameworks and developing certification, auditing and compliance tools at EU level",
   "Machines cannot bear moral responsibility; adapt liability and criminal-law duties for manufacturers and keepers; robot legal personhood to be monitored",
   "Calls for public investment, requalification of workers and broad citizen participation"
